    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32815" root="فأد" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُفْؤُودٌ</span></b>  <i>A place which one makes, for a cake of
bread,</i> or <i>lump of dough, in hot ashes,</i> or <i>in a fire,
to put it therein</i> [<i>for the purpose of baking it</i>]:
(S, M, * L, K: *) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفَائِيدُ</span>. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَئِيدٌ</span>.

